<title>GERMANY: Wuensche ups Jean Pascale stake.</title>
<headline>Wuensche ups Jean Pascale stake.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wuensche AG said on Tuesday that it had raised its stake in textile trading company Jean Pascale AG to 76 percent by acquiring a 25 percent stake from WCM Beteiligungs- und Grundbesitz AG.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details, but recently-appointed Wuensche chief executive Peter Littman has said he wants to build the group into a pure textiles business. Wuensche plans to sell its property activities by the end of this year.</p>
</text>
